    "title": "Police warn of scam happening in popular River North area - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Izzy Stroobandt ,\n2 hours ago Chicago police are warning of a scam run by a group of men asking for donations or a \"follow\" on social media in a popular area of River North. A group of three to eight suspects are transferring themselves money via Zelle or Apple Pay after tricking people into giving them their phones, police said. The suspects often ask people for a donation or a \"follow\" on Instagram. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
